      },
      {
        "html": "Players can take the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Diary_(Shades_of_Mort%27ton)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">diary of Herbi Flax</a> to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Apothecary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Apothecary</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock</a> who will exchange the book for 335 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Herblore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Herblore</a> experience. This can only be done once.",
        "text": "Players can take the diary of Herbi Flax to the Apothecary in Varrock who will exchange the book for 335 Herblore experience. This can only be done once.",
